{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0244_1000_p", "source_sha256": "634588a0481bfab767d45ecf2223cc8fbaa7a5461fc5b412f7effae63a02d1bd", "ja": "（今日は新作映画の撮影！　機械都市を舞台にした、\nスチームパンクがモチーフの物語だ）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄新电影！这是一个以机械都市为舞台、以蒸汽朋克为主题的故事。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0244_1001_p", "source_sha256": "4a5281e64f3be0bc4eb88751d34a1ead94d3306bfc192942792d161e30a77f68", "ja": "（恵美は、ロボット政府に反逆する飛行士を演じる。\nイメージが難しそうな役どころだけど……さて）", "zh": "（惠美饰演的是一名反抗机器人政府的飞行员。这个角色似乎很难把握……那么，她会表现得怎么样呢）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0244_1002_020meg", "source_sha256": "df4a6e502eb47a8ca3208a9df59ff1b865b0fc7e2aad36b0b1f490e6c4387d61", "ja": "確かに、アンタたち機械に比べたら、\nアタシら人間は、非合理的な存在かもね。", "zh": "确实，跟你们这些机器相比，\n我们人类，也许是不合理的存在。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0244_1003_020meg", "source_sha256": "2cc104d8c7cc08af595a6a11d56c7b8c3c582560436e91ae07bb3cdf296f35c7", "ja": "不器用で、泥臭くて……でも、そこがいいんだって！\nモモコ……アンタには、わかって欲しいんだ。", "zh": "笨拙、土里土气……但正因为这样才好啊！桃子……我希望你能明白这一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0244_1004_020meg", "source_sha256": "dc65986bfc7904d212a358f808e380079d2edf5f1aeb98fa34b7c95a57e9be2a", "ja": "もしかしたらアンタは、人間と機械の架け橋に\nなるために、生まれたのかも……なんて、ね。", "zh": "说不定你就是为了成为人类与机械之间的\n桥梁，才诞生到这个世上的呢……开玩笑的啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0244_1005_null", "source_sha256": "a1269628ae1a31b7c3027a5c36e0f5ec7f2b4dcc51bd33ce7866202fe4c2df78", "ja": "休憩中……", "zh": "休息中……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0244_1006_p", "source_sha256": "7ed512c145a6a6383ea2cfab39f299321c88269dc10756da37b21c81750dd822", "ja": "恵美、お疲れさま！\nいい演技だったな、引き込まれたよ。", "zh": "惠美，辛苦了！\n演得很棒啊，我都看入迷了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0244_1007_020meg", "source_sha256": "7457e5922258d98634ca27edd2e1e8d2dda708afb81ab7fb023d406b04b23ef9", "ja": "ありがと♪　いや～、台本読んだ時は\nうまく演じられるかな～って不安だったんだけど。", "zh": "谢谢♪　哎呀～读剧本的时候，我还在担心自己能不能演好呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0244_1008_020meg", "source_sha256": "1ed1d560d545b1f789d8058789ceb03a792f89902a2b4b2014464085ee86d575", "ja": "みんなに相談してみて、よかったよ！\n演技について、一緒に考えてくれてさ～。", "zh": "去找大家商量了一下，真是太好了！\n她们还和我一起琢磨了演技呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0244_1009_p", "source_sha256": "c6d6146aec459deddd8f1b931e4e9766a4aac41029763be824a78977a2f27ee1", "ja": "へえ、そんな事してたんだな。", "zh": "哦，原来你在做这种事啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0244_1010_020meg", "source_sha256": "19378b3189574189d5bb9e4094691dc06cb22e749d87a004f2c9ab480660d31a", "ja": "うん！　アタシが自主練してる時にね、\nみんなの方から、協力するって言ってくれたんだ♪", "zh": "嗯！我自主练习的时候，大家主动说要来帮忙的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0244_1011_020meg", "source_sha256": "010dfebe546cf026dd379e3313248089b72246db32d31b159089d87db5e6fd93", "ja": "今回のアタシの役ってさ、\n無鉄砲で命知らずな飛行機乗り、なワケだけど……。", "zh": "这次我演的角色吧，是个莽撞又不怕死的飞行员，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0244_1012_020meg", "source_sha256": "352ebc3514ead7e64e452891aba58818f418a32d9d9f69e9e6bafe527878ba75", "ja": "ほらアタシ、そんなに勇敢な方じゃないじゃん？\nチャリだっていつも安全運転だし。", "zh": "你看，我又不是那种很勇敢的人，对吧？连骑自行车我都一直很注意安全。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0244_1013_p", "source_sha256": "c2ae408a01565a7cfc00712522e8efc8525b8b40cd17e836ec9545f2dfe66b3a", "ja": "それはその方がいいと思うけど……まあ恵美は\nなんだかんだ、落ち着いたところはある気がするな。", "zh": "我觉得那样比较好……不过，惠美不管怎么说，还是有沉稳的一面。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0244_1014_020meg", "source_sha256": "b5abe0416febfda5c0f2be069a0bcd54f5ba3ad30b08d469378aed661d042836", "ja": "そうなんだよ～。でもね、みんなから言われたんだ。\nこの役、アタシに似てるとこあるって。", "zh": "就是这样嘛～不过大家都说，这个角色有些地方和我很像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0244_1015_020meg", "source_sha256": "849567d25a230580faa2a8650506501c683665f3df955ed11ad8a45563e6be8e", "ja": "「仲間が困ってたら、助けてあげるでしょ？」って。\nアタシ、そっかーって思ってさ～！", "zh": "“同伴遇到困难的话，你会去帮他们对吧？”这样。\n我也觉得，原来是这么回事啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0244_1016_020meg", "source_sha256": "0163aae52bd16b76400db8302e38ed04834434a2e7f757dd0dd19461148b82cd", "ja": "ただ無鉄砲とか、命知らずなんじゃなくて……。\n仲間のためなら頑張れる、って事なんだって。", "zh": "不是单纯的鲁莽，也不是不把命当回事……而是为了伙伴，就能努力到这种程度。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0244_1017_p", "source_sha256": "102837b30f3d07b56aa8d7a9bc9985f621d50e057e9bab5edcaee2ff1ddffc61", "ja": "なるほど、そうか……。\n確かにそういうところは、恵美らしいな。", "zh": "原来如此，是这样啊……\n确实，这一点很像惠美。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0244_1018_020meg", "source_sha256": "6eb9181dc9c8a8f3de091706245d7ab577c92335ae6b83d6c93cdb2c829bf711", "ja": "だから、いつも通りのアタシを意識してやれば、\nいけるかも！って思ったんだ。", "zh": "所以我就想，只要有意识地保持平时的我去做，说不定就行了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0244_1019_020meg", "source_sha256": "8a26c178c317fefa782d12259bd8e4ae5bcb8f61f6988555501068a7d3ece26f", "ja": "まあ、本当に命を懸けろって言われたら、\nさすがにちょっと怖いけどさ……にゃはは♪", "zh": "不过，要是真让我拿命去拼的话，\n果然还是会有点害怕啦……喵哈哈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0244_1020_p", "source_sha256": "814c5e622e5f00485b191dd75e351ec2480b602feae26745e7101ae919541e69", "ja": "そりゃそうだよ。これはお話だから。", "zh": "那当然啊。这只是故事嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0244_1021_p", "source_sha256": "40682b527e62b5443e7db5a67f1f2b164ddd7984bd271eab0d562580b183ee5e", "ja": "……ああ、でも。今日の恵美の演技は、\n本当に命懸けのように感じたよ。それくらい凄かった。", "zh": "……啊，不过，今天惠美的演技，真的让人感觉像是拼上了性命一样。厉害到了这种程度。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0244_1022_020meg", "source_sha256": "0e499f7d1331d38001f405e5a1abb69520abbf908b64e73dc302a2df6dfb13e2", "ja": "そこまで？　それは嬉しいけど……。\n付き合ってくれたみんなには、迷惑かけちゃったかも。", "zh": "有那么夸张吗？我当然很高兴啦……不过，可能给陪我演出的大家添麻烦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0244_1023_p", "source_sha256": "c46339f30b1a9e6d4981cd09370b78dc8c60d2a12e2955d5af4cf8b74e5b0ab8", "ja": "迷惑だなんて、誰も思ってないと思うぞ？\nそれに……迷惑くらい、かけたっていいじゃないか。", "zh": "我觉得谁都没把这当成麻烦吧？\n而且……偶尔给别人添点麻烦也没什么不好啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0244_1024_020meg", "source_sha256": "fdde8c5e58bf283b417e9c3949d3ea4f16f015c722f338a6242c8c6191da4c2c", "ja": "あ……えへへ、そっか。そうだよね！\nみんなには、後でお礼言っとこ。", "zh": "啊……嘿嘿，是这样啊。说得对！\n之后得向大家道谢才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0244_1025_020meg", "source_sha256": "08154e10a75f90b82319d7e19178a884430f4503013638fb8a6167f6db26ed11", "ja": "{$P$}もありがとね！\nそんじゃ続きの撮影も、命懸けで頑張るよ、にゃはは♪", "zh": "{$P$}也谢谢你啦！\n那么接下来的拍摄，我也会拼命加油的，喵哈哈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
